## Learning

martial-art-learn-AlreadyKnown = You already know this art.
martial-art-learn-NotCultivator = These techniques move qi. Without a cultivated dantian, the words mean nothing to you.
martial-art-learn-RealmTooLow = Your cultivation is too shallow to grasp this yet.
martial-art-learn-NoRoom = Your body cannot hold another art of this kind.
martial-art-learned = You have learned {$art}.
martial-art-learned-forbidden = You have learned {$art}. Something cold settles in your meridians.
martial-art-too-tired = You're too exhausted for that.
martial-art-dark-arts-examine = [color=#a01c3a]Being near {OBJECT($target)} makes your skin crawl.[/color]

