## Effects

martial-art-dragon-palm = {CAPITALIZE(THE($user))} drives a dragon palm into {THE($target)}! ({$stacks})
martial-art-dragon-palm-final = The haughty dragon repents! {CAPITALIZE(THE($user))}'s final palm hurls {THE($target)} to the ground!
martial-art-northern-darkness = {CAPITALIZE(THE($user))} drinks in {THE($target)}'s strength like the sea takes in rivers.
martial-art-star-absorbing = {CAPITALIZE(THE($user))} tears the qi out of {THE($target)}!
martial-art-star-absorbing-clash = The stolen qi clashes in your meridians!
martial-art-great-shift = The air around {THE($user)} begins to turn.
martial-art-great-shift-turn = {CAPITALIZE(THE($user))} turns the projectile back on its way!
martial-art-nine-yang-heal = Warm yang qi soothes your bruised meridians.
martial-art-golden-bell = A low bell tolls as {THE($user)}'s skin takes on a golden sheen.
martial-art-graceful-steps = {CAPITALIZE(THE($user))}'s steps turn light and quick as rippling water.
martial-art-ladder-cloud = {CAPITALIZE(THE($user))} springs off the air itself!
martial-art-dugu-ready = {CAPITALIZE(THE($user))} lowers {POSS-ADJ($user)} guard, watching.
martial-art-dugu-counter = {CAPITALIZE(THE($user))} reads the flaw in {THE($target)}'s blow and breaks it!
martial-art-hedgehog-thorns = Barbs in {THE($target)}'s armor bite into you!
